#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "392_Tanimura"
msgid "Ever heard of 777 Town?"
msgstr "¿Alguna vez has oído hablar de 777 Town?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "404_Himeka"
msgid "777 Town? What's that?"
msgstr "¿777 Town? ¿Y eso qué es?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "416_Tanimura"
msgid "It's a game for your computer or cell phone. It lets you play pachinko and slots anytime and anywhere you want."
msgstr "Es un juego para el teléfono y la computadora. Te permite jugar al pachinko y a las tragamonedas en cualquier momento y lugar donde sea que estés."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "428_Himeka"
msgid "Wow, really?"
msgstr "¿Vaya, en serio?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "440_Himeka"
msgid "It's too bad I'm not really a pachinko person."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "452_Tanimura"
msgid "I gotcha..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "464_Tanimura"
msgid "Ever heard of Amoebatar?"
msgstr "¿Has oído hablar de Amoebatar?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "476_Himeka"
msgid "Afraid not. What is it?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "488_Tanimura"
msgid "It's an online community that lets you create an avatar of yourself. The number of members has skyrocketed lately."
msgstr "Es una comunidad en línea que te permite crear un avatar de ti mismo. El número de miembros ha aumentado muchísimo últimamente."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "500_Himeka"
msgid "Wow, I never knew somethin' like that existed! ♪ Sounds\\r\nlike fun. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "512_Tanimura"
msgid "You can also play games and chat. Wanna try it together sometime?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "524_Himeka"
msgid "Sure! ♪ I hope I can get my avatar to look like me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "536_Tanimura"
msgid "Hear about the ghost in the underground mall?"
msgstr "¿Escuchaste sobre el fantasma que hay en el centro comercial subterráneo?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "548_Himeka"
msgid "Huh!? What!?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "560_Tanimura"
msgid "When they were first building the mall, a construction worker had an accident and died."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "572_Tanimura"
msgid "Now, night after night, his ghost appears to wander the empty mall."
msgstr "Ahora, cuando cae la noche, su fantasma deambula por el centro comercial vacío."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "584_Himeka"
msgid "Really!? That's awful frightenin'."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "596_Himeka"
msgid "Now I won't be able to go there by myself! You just had to tell me that, didn't ya?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "608_Tanimura"
msgid "Hear about the footbaths at Yunosono Hot Springs? You don't take off your clothes, so men and women can go in together."
msgstr "¿Has oído hablar de los baños de pies de las Aguas termales Yunosono? No hace falta que te quites la ropa, así que hombres y mujeres pueden entrar juntos."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "620_Himeka"
msgid "Oh, sounds great! ♪ I love footbaths! They really warm your body up! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "632_Tanimura"
msgid "It'll make your skin shine, too."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "644_Himeka"
msgid "Yeah. ♪ I should go sometime."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "656_Tanimura"
msgid "Golf is getting pretty popular. A lot of couples go on golf dates lately."
msgstr "El golf se está haciendo muy popular. Últimamente muchas parejas salen a jugar al golf."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "668_Himeka"
msgid "Golf dates, huh? <Color:7>♥<Color:Default> Sounds nice. It's really a luxury sport, ain't it? <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "680_Tanimura"
msgid "I like playing on an actual course. Beats a practice range any day."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "692_Himeka"
msgid "Yeah. ♪ I wanna get a hole-in-one! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "704_Tanimura"
msgid "Do you order liver when you go out for yakiniku? They say liver's got arachidonic acid, which reverses aging in the brain."
msgstr "¿Ordenas hígado cuando sales a comer yakiniku? Dicen que tiene ácido araquidónico, el cual ayuda a revertir el envejecimiento cerebral."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "716_Himeka"
msgid "It does? I eat liver all the time. I love it! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "728_Tanimura"
msgid "It's good for your memory too. That probably explains why you remember the faces of your customers so well."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "740_Himeka"
msgid "Oh, wow. ♪ I'm glad I've been eatin' it then! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "752_Tanimura"
msgid "Did you know pole dancing is great for working out?"
msgstr "¿Sabías que el pole dance es genial para hacer ejercicio?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "764_Himeka"
msgid "Pole dancing? You mean naked girls dancing for men?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "776_Tanimura"
msgid "Well, most pole dancers don't go completely naked. The dance works all your muscles, so it's great for a slim physique."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "788_Himeka"
msgid "That so? I haven't been exercisin' lately, so it wouldn't hurt to give it a try."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "800_Tanimura"
msgid "Sweet sake is all the rage now. Women order it all the time when eating at Sushi Gin."
msgstr "El sake dulce ahora está de moda. Las mujeres lo suelen ordenar todo el tiempo en el Sushi Gin."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "812_Himeka"
msgid "Yeah, I know! ♪ I've had some myself. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "824_Tanimura"
msgid "The alcohol percentage isn't that high, and it's got a fruity taste, so it's easy to drink."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "836_Himeka"
msgid "Yep! ♪ It might be too easy to drink, though. I sometimes get more than a little tipsy..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "884_Tanimura"
msgid "So about 777 Town..."
msgstr "Acerca del 777 Town..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "896_Himeka"
msgid "That again? Gamblin' is all you can think about, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "908_Tanimura"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "920_Tanimura"
msgid "Have you tried Amoebatar?"
msgstr "¿Has probado Amoebatar?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "932_Himeka"
msgid "Yeah! It's pretty fun!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "944_Himeka"
msgid "Thanks for tellin' me about it. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "956_Tanimura"
msgid "Sounds like you're hooked."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "968_Tanimura"
msgid "So about that ghost in the underground mall..."
msgstr "Acerca del fantasma del centro comercial..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "980_Himeka"
msgid "Could ya stop talkin' about that? I don't wanna get more spooked than I already am!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "992_Tanimura"
msgid "Oh, okay... Sorry..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1004_Tanimura"
msgid "Did you try out the footbaths at Yunosono?"
msgstr "¿Probaste los baños de pies en Yunosono?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1016_Himeka"
msgid "Yeah! I went just the other day! The bottom of the bath was stony and rugged, so it really stimulated my pressure points! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1028_Tanimura"
msgid "It probably helped your circulation. Your skin definitely seems more radiant."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1040_Himeka"
msgid "Hehehe. ♪ And it's all thanks to you, Tanimura-san. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1052_Tanimura"
msgid "How's your golfing? Did you start yet?"
msgstr "¿Qué tal el golf? ¿Ya fuiste a jugar?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1064_Himeka"
msgid "A lotta the girls here are pretty into it. We might go as a group sometime. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1076_Tanimura"
msgid "Wow, a hostess golf tour. Sounds like fun."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1088_Himeka"
msgid "Yep! ♪ I'm gonna do my best to get myself that consolation prize! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1100_Tanimura"
msgid "Isn't that the prize you don't want to get?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1112_Tanimura"
msgid "Have you been eating liver lately?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1124_Himeka"
msgid "Hehehe. ♪ I have. I went to Kanrai the other day, so I bet I got even smarter! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1136_Tanimura"
msgid "I see... Well eating too much isn't great either, so keep it in moderation."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1148_Tanimura"
msgid "About that pole dancing workout..."
msgstr "Sobre hacer ejercicio con pole dance..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1160_Himeka"
msgid "Oh, that? I don't think it's for me. It's not like I wanna go on a diet anyways."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1172_Tanimura"
msgid "I gotcha."
msgstr "Te entiendo, niño."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1184_Tanimura"
msgid "Have you been drinking sweet sake lately?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1196_Himeka"
msgid "Yeah, I have! ♪ When it's just us girls eating out, it really hits the spot. It's so easy to drink. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1208_Himeka"
msgid "I wish they had it here at the club. The girls would love it. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1220_Tanimura"
msgid "I can see that."
msgstr ""

